<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:31.770
<i>Despite it being only a single small Dianna Counter team, their attack against the Willgem put it in great danger.</i>

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.650
<i>The White Doll began to show its true potential...</i>

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:40.070
<i>...which allowed the Willgem to fly towards the ancient legendary Adeskan world tree...</i>

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.370
<i>...in order to reach the Branch of Ades, the Zacktraeger.</i>

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:54.210
<b>Zacktraeger</b>

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.390
Almost there. Raise us just five more meters!

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.890
Re-routing power from the Mega Particle Cannon.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:12.820
Is this ship truly going into space and to the moon?

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:16.990
Are we really flying?

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.200
How should I know?

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.910
This isn't what I enlisted for...

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.620
You realize our air in there will start to thin out pretty quickly, right?

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.620
You can use this computer.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.710
Miss Sochie, Miss Miashei, and members of the suicide Squadron...

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.590
As of now, the Willgem is in space.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.800
Remain inside your cockpit, or you will not survive.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.510
You got that, Miashei?

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:39.010
Understood.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:42.010
Mr. Ames, Mr. John, did you get that?

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:45.810
Weren't these mechanical dolls originally designed for space use?

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.680
Hey, is that a bucket approaching us?

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.730
What do you mean, bucket?

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:59.320
Our relative speed must be lowered to zero once we've entered the Zacktraeger...

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.700
- Do you understand?
- Yes

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.490
There are also probably servicing and inspection teams inside there.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.490
Do you copy that, Willgem?

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.000
We've got you.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.500
We're now reducing our velocity...

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.000
...to Zero, like you said.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.420
Are you positive about that?

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:15.210
- That's right, just sit down.
- There's no where else to sit!

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:23.390
Just a hair to the left...!

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.390
And we've done it!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.580
Zacktraeger's Docking is now complete, Lieutenant.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.800
Seems like we did it, Great work.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:01.090
But I thought Dianna Counter would also be here.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.800
Is that it, then?

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.300
No. Colonel Michael, please make your broadcast.

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:15.600
Right. We have now entered into space. It's a vacuum. Make sure to wear your space suit when you exit the ship.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:20.900
Also, all Militia men must closely listen to any Moonrace technician's instructions before trying anything.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:25.280
The excavated ship? Why would it be in the Zacktraeger?

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.700
What do you want us to do? Harry Ord's SUMO is there as well.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.490
Just monitor it.

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:33.710
At any rate, we must focus on the timing of our return to the moon.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:38.210
Lieutenant Harry accompanied the Willgem here to the Zacktraeger?

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.000
Is that you, Midgard?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.710
Forgive my interruption.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.380
I believe you understand our current status.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.720
Please accompany me to the bridge.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.390
And what of the soldiers stationed on the Zacktraeger?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:52.310
I'll have them deploy their Mobile Suit teams.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:56.600
We have no idea what those Militia barbarians intend to do up here.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.480
Hands up!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.610
I just assisted your Willgem, you know?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:07.610
I understand that, but you're also from Dianna's Royal Guard... So I have to confine you.

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:11.200
Hey, you in that space suit. Are you in pain?

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:13.000
I couldn't breathe!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.000
Naturally. That helmet had no air in it.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.790
These are the space suits that were made for the Willgem's crew...

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.710
They have to be set properly.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.300
Now try the helmet on.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.800
Your visor can open as well.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.100
We can't move from here?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.180
They're automated docking arms, so...

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:37.190
No... Once they've grabbed us, they won't let go.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:41.190
The space docking arm must be controlled by somebody.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.820
I'm not getting any response.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.900
Honestly...

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:48.700
Don't tell me Chief Horace and the others tricked us to lure us out here?

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.910
I'm afraid I don't have an answer for that.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:55.290
It seems like we'll have to go outside to remove those docking arms.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.210
Watch the flash on that thing!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:00.210
But, it was a good photo opportunity!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:03.920
With someone from the Royal Guard and the Militia in their space suits...

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.800
...and even Dianna Soriel is here.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.300
So how do you operate this helmet?

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:12.010
Miashei, learn to use the space suit somewhere else.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:16.390
Tell me! This ship is now immobile thanks to your people, isn't it!?

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.890
Your suspicions are understandable, but misplaced.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.310
In that case, why did you sneak aboard?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.690
Haven't you realized just who has also done so, Lieutenant?

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.480
What do you mean?

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:31.200
The fact is that you people are the ones who've entered your enemy's territory. You must understand this.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.910
Then you're suggesting we're the uninvited guests?

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.120
Yep. That's correct.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.290
We could use you as a hostage.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.210
I would not be a suitable one.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:43.000
Then you've truly turned against the moon?

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.920
Well, you could call it that.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.710
Many things are happening within Dianna Counter.

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:50.220
I hope I've lived up to your expectations.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:53.220
Colonel Michael, the Lieutenant will help us.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.680
He poses no threat to us.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:59.020
The way things are now, he couldn't do much to hamper us even if he wanted to.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:02.190
I also believe you're on pretty good terms with this man, Miss Kihel Heim.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.400
Isn't she Dianna?

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.610
She is Queen Dianna.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.610
Colonel?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.990
Then, she'll be Dianna Soriel.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.820
Correct.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:19.410
I must ask you, Lady Cancer and Sir Muron, please go into space and fight for our defense.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:22.500
However, before the Gendarme exits the Zacktraeger...

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.920
...I request that you do not use your Mobile Suits against them.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.510
Have you requested for reinforcements from the central hub?

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.720
Yes sir, two WaDoms will launch.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.590
They're taking their sweet time.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.920
The Militia's ship docked together with a Royal Guard's SUMO.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.290
Their true objective is unknown.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.920
Just fight them off if they make any hostile moves.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.010
If necessary, use lethal force...

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:16.010
But don't allow either the Zacktraeger or Gendarme to be damaged.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:24.520
We've received no responses from them, but Dianna Counter is here.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.310
This is pretty nice.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.320
Madame, quit playing around.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.690
There's gravity in here?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:34.200
While we're docked in this place, our inertia creates limited gravity

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:35.610
Sir Guin...

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:36.490
Over here.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:39.280
What about a ship wide inspection? Without Chief Horace around...

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.790
Once we get these space suits on, we'll do it ourselves.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.410
- So you have a manual?
- Yeah.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.420
And so, this is how you attach the helmet.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.920
Won't we hit each other?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.710
We just have to take care not to collide.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:54.720
Why didn't Mr. Horace make any more pilot suits himself?

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.800
Things like that are too expensive to make in large amounts.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.680
Lady Lily... What in the world are you doing!?

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.180
Aren't we changing?

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.600
You're supposed to wear it on top of your clothes.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.110
I see. Otherwise, it'd feel too cold and hard.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:13.820
Laura, you and Sochie will go investigate the area around the Control Room.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.200
Investigate?

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.990
They're likely to deploy their attack unit from there.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:17.990
They're coming.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:21.410
But we can't fight them while here.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.500
We can't allow them to interfere with the Willgem's hull inspection either.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.500
- Bring Colonel Michael down here.
 - Sir!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:30.710
The White Doll's chest is still burdened with the nuclear bombs...

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:33.590
If Loran prefers not to go out, Miashei and I can go.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.590
That's right.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.720
The earth and space are quite different.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.090
You don't want to head out there yet, Milady!

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:40.600
We'll be fine as long as we're wearing these.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:44.390
In space, it'll take more than a simple change of clothes to survive.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.690
That's why I want you to lead them, Laura.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:50.110
Miashei, the Willgem will need you to stay here and protect it.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.980
- Fine with me.
- Where are we going?

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:55.190
I was planning to fly around this cylindrical dock.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:58.910
Has Queen Dianna come to space, as well?

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:03.620
Correct, she's currently in the Zacktraeger's second docking bay.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.700
They have yet to depart.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:09.580
Lieutenant, are you against Queen Dianna returning to the moon?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.590
I do not wish for her to meet with Agrippa alone.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:18.090
Can you see through that face guard?

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.720
The view is projected by some sort of television.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:24.010
But I can't say the pants are very feminine...I don't like them.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.890
What is it?

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:30.690
The Lieutenant would like to attempt to negotiate with the Zacktraeger forces.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.900
Allow me to use your communication equipment.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.610
They haven't responded to us yet.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:39.990
In that case, the Lieutenant could try visiting the control room directly.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:41.200
You'd go using the SUMO?

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.700
And the Lieutenant would be willing to do that favor for us?

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.200
Correct.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.500
The image you see there... what does it show?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.290
You mean here?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:54.000
Aside from the inside of a barrel, we can see the Gendarme!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.010
That's on the deck immediately above the Willgem!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.220
Above us?

00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:59.510
You're saying we're on the same deck!?

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.090
In that case...

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:04.220
It'll depart for the moon at the next timing cycle!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:07.890
How in the world could I not have noticed this earlier!?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.190
- That ship is where Queen Dianna is?
- Yes.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.020
We should use this guy.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:15.900
It'd be impossible to start a ship to ship battle while we're in here. Tell everyone to prepare themselves!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:16.690
Understood.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:18.190
Inform Laura and Sochie of everything.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.820
- Lieutenant Yanni!
- Sir!

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.110
Lieutenant Harry!

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:40.590
Are you fighting as well, Lieutenant?

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.300
Listen to me, Lady Sochie...

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:47.010
You absolutely must not use your guns inside Zacktraeger's dock!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:50.890
Act as though you're unaware of them as we move off this deck.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.600
Did you hear him?

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.600
Why can't we use the radio?

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:56.610
The enemy could intercept our signal.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.610
We must use direct contact line to communicate.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.690
Please open the shutter!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.510
I will go and to rescue Queen Dianna.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.130
Huh? Is she here in this place as well?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.760
Let me hear you too!

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:31.630
Sochie, the battle ship up there wishes to avoid engaging in any fighting.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.560
I believe I'm beginning to understand.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:39.570
So in that case, Sochie, please pretend that you and Loran haven't noticed it when you leave.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.030
And you, Lieutenant?

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.360
I'll move elsewhere.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.950
You two must act as our ship's guards.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:44.700
Right.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.250
Harry has yet to notice us.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.680
- Seems that way.
-  Your watchdog doesn't seem very reliable.

00:12:57.680 --> 00:13:01.880
But based on the way he's collaborating with our enemy, we can assume he's betrayed us.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:05.550
Lieutenant Harry also only wishes for peace with the earth.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.430
They're coming.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.140
Lieutenant Harry...

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.030
There isn't any response. Do they wish to continue the silence?

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.040
Loran, what is that?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.040
It's so blue and white, what is it?

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:42.460
That's the earth.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:46.930
You can see the Atlantic Ocean, and the North Ameria Continent is to the right of it.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:50.350
You must be kidding! If that's where we live, we're way too high up!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.430
We did climb up quite a ways.

00:13:54.720 --> 00:14:01.360
It's no use... As far as I can tell, Our data from Mr. Horace doesn't include anything on the Zacktraeger's control system.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:09.030
There's some movement between the cylinder and the central hub...

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.950
What are you babbling about now?

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.030
Sorry.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.540
I see something moving.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.120
What's that?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:22.750
It's a linear motor car that's used to travel between the cylinder and the central hub.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:23.460
Linear car?

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.630
Correct, it's a way to save energy.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:31.550
So you're saying that this is the route Dianna Counter's Mechanical Dolls would use?

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.620
It's probable.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:34.680
I see!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.850
Milady... You mustn't!

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:47.050
It seems as though this bar can be used by any mechanical doll.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.880
This is the first thing that the Dianna Counter forces would use! We should try a different approach.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:51.740
Don't be a coward.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.290
Between us and the Central hub...

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:01.580
...there's an equivalent to the distance between the east and west coasts of North Ameria.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.790
Is it really that far?

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:07.590
I believe there should be another control room on top of that docking tube's block, don't you think?

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.970
That could be.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:10.760
This thing is huge.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:24.980
The one on the right is none other than Queen Dianna.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:29.490
That damned Midgard would dare to use that woman as a shield!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.490
He seems to be using some sort of sign. What could that mean?

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:35.280
I could assume that you understand the meaning of that sign.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.080
That's one of Lieutenant Harry's awkward habits.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.580
He thinks doing that makes him look dandy.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.000
Amusing, isn't it?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:45.290
It is indeed amusing to see a Mobile suit doing that.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.170
More or less.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.170
The two WaDoms are now approaching.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:54.470
Alright, once we have departed from here, their units will attack the Militia.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:58.470
Cancer, Muron, be ready to assist them.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.400
There we are, the circuit is now connected.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.360
We'll leave at the next opening window, correct?

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.860
Yes, however...

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.780
These are the communications between the Gendarme and the station's staff.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.360
We can intercept their radio transmissions?

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:17.370
Actually, it seems that Lieutenant Harry has directly connected us with them.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:22.870
The people from the Control Room intend to capture the Willgem.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:23.960
Lieutenant Yanni...

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.170
Yes, Colonel?

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:30.800
We'll begin our plan to destroy the docking arms which are holding the Willgem in place.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.760
The docking arms?

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:36.590
Have the technicians tell you how the arms are constructed.

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.760
Send out two Borjarnons.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:42.770
Miss Miashei, do we have any more airtight suits for our Miss Kihel or Dianna?

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.980
Thank you for your concern.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.900
It's not a problem.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.360
Here, wear this.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.770
Thank you.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:52.780
Miss Fran, do you know anything about this Zacktraeger?

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:57.280
- No, I don't know anything about it.
- Will we be launching any of the Armadillos?

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.490
The people of earth are very brave.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.370
Miss Kihel Heim?

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.790
You know who I am?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.370
You've made it this far, so keep up the good performance.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:06.460
For everyone...

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:10.960
Of course. It's better if we let everyone believe you're her, isn't it?

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.960
It's all for the Willgem's sake.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.470
Thank you, Miss Fran Doll...

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.680
The WaDoms are approaching!

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.970
Loran, Sochie, the WaDoms are approaching us!

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:24.180
Please, be careful!

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.270
Are you hearing me?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.190
Are the Mechanical Dolls coming?

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.690
It seems as though there are more rails for the linear motor over there.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.490
And what about the Control Room?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:41.080
I'm more worried about the WaDom's actions at the moment.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:45.660
Even Lieutenant Harry told us that we should try to prevent them from causing trouble.

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:50.460
They're coming.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.880
There seem to be two Mobile Suits approaching.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.190
Scarecrows!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.980
It looks like they have good mobility in space as well!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:16.860
Despite being part of the Moonrace, you never knew that?

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.990
I'm sorry, but I didn't.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.280
I am Lieutenant Harry Ord of the Royal Guard.

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:28.580
Regardless of what the Gendarme may have said, the Militia's spacecraft is to approach the moon as well.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:32.460
Please release the docking arms when the launch window comes.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.460
We did not receive any such orders!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.760
Even up here, there are scarecrows...

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.590
Well, they arrived from the moon, so it's to be expected.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:43.390
This is an order from a Royal Guard's SUMO!

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.390
We do not have to follow such orders!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:48.890
It's almost comforting to see such a familiar sight here.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.560
Lady Lily?

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.400
Please, allow me to use the microphone.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.860
What do you intend to do?

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:57.690
As Dianna, I shall issue orders to the soldiers stationed here.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.360
Can you do it?

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:04.780
I'm not sure what orders they're currently under, however, I'll try doing what I can.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.290
Mr. Jacop, the microphone!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:13.960
What is this?

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:16.460
We will be departing momentarily.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:20.880
In order to avoid taking damage in an attack against the Militia...

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:23.470
The WaDoms were sent in to keep them occupied.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.260
And then what?

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.390
An attack on the Willgem can't begin while it's still here!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:33.900
The Zacktraeger was originally a sacred sanctuary that even Dianna Counter wasn't given access too.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:35.690
Microphone.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.570
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:44.490
All forces who are currently stationed here on the Zacktraeger, I am Dianna Soriel!

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:47.080
I am now using the Militia's spacecraft...

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:51.080
And am leading these people away from earth to conduct peace negotiations.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.170
Queen Dianna?

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:57.090
- Regardless of whatever orders that the soldiers of Zacktraeger may be under...

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.290
- The one on the Gendarme, as well?

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:03.470
In order to ensure that the Gendarme remains unharmed, and that the Willgem's trip to the moon isn't prevented...

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:06.760
Nothing must be allowed to disturb the sanctity of the Zacktraeger.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:08.260
A battle here is not permitted.

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:10.980
The Militia is using your imposter.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:12.690
What should I do?

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.980
That is an insult to the name of Dianna Soriel!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.690
I see.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.360
This is Dianna Soriel's order to the Zacktraeger's forces...

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:24.360
The Gendarme will now launch from the Zacktraeger as scheduled.

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:33.160
If there is any attack from the Militia against the Gendarme as it leaves, your Mobile Suit troops are allowed to return fire as necessary.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:38.960
However, if no such attack is made by the Militia, any combat here is forbidden.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:43.970
This is the notification of our terms to the Militia from Dianna Counter's Commander.

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:51.770
So long as this is understood, there we can overlook the sins of the soldiers stationed in this location.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.190
- We're ready to proceed.
- Go ahead.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.280
Amazing.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.460
From Dianna Soriel To Dianna Soriel.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:17.880
From Kihel Heim to Kihel Heim.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.590
Let us meet once again.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.180
It's going to hit!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.480
I couldn't reclaim you from Midgard's clutches!

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:37.770
Queen Dianna is leaving!

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:40.360
This is a space ship?

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:54.040
We pray you have a safe Journey, Queen Dianna Soriel!

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:02.960
I will leave the Zacktraeger's maintenance in your hands.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:44.110
<i>The Militia's men have a difficult time adapting to space.</i>

00:23:45.310 --> 00:23:47.400
<i>After they take Lady Kihel hostage...</i>

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:50.650
<i>...they threaten to force Willgem to return to earth.</i>

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:55.620
<i>Will Lieutenant Harry's help be able to prevent this coup d'etat?</i>

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:00.330
<i>Next time... on TURN A GUNDAM...</i>

00:24:00.990 --> 00:24:03.040
<i>The Militia's Decisive Space Battle</i>

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:05.130
The wind rages in space.

00:24:03.620 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>The Militia's Decisive Space Battle</b>
